				<wikidot:authorName>RJB_R</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1229263</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Joan and Bick have an easygoing chemistry that made them enjoyable to read. That SCP-011 log is fantastic, it really arrested me and I felt for those characters even in such a short space of the story. I don’t think I fully understand the context Joan and Bick find themselves in but the way they carry themselves makes the world feel fully realized, at least in so far as I believe these characters exist in this space you’ve created. I would read more about Joan and Bick if there are more stories now or later.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
